{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p070b","title":"晋武帝诏褒王经赐经孙郎中","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p070b-account","label":"《汉晋春秋》","text":"晋武帝诏褒王经赐经孙郎中","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p070b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0136","role":"诏褒","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p070b-q"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0128","role":"受官","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p070b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":265,"label":"泰始元年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xiahoucao-y265","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xiahoucao-q-p070","basis":"泰始元年"},"evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p070b-q","xiahoucao-q-p070","shaodi-q-o184","shaodi-q-o171","shaodi-q-o165","shaodi-q-b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-p070b-q","source_order":[9,642,"P070b"],"order":2383}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0136","name":"司马炎","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xiahoucao-p0128","name":"王经孙（未具名）","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-q-b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：景元四年（公元 263）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ef642248e44d01f3825d","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o165","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b35fdf03685051716720","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，复命大将军进位、爵赐，一如前诏。又固辞，乃止。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o171","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-cef469d41ec5962b4e48","layer":"original","quote":"咸熙元年春正月，壬戌〖1〗，槛车征邓艾〖2〗。甲子〖3〗，行幸长安。壬申〖4〗，使使者以璧币祀华山〖5〗。是月，钟会反于蜀，为众所讨。邓艾亦见杀。二月，辛卯〖6〗，特赦诸在益土者。庚申〖7〗，葬明元郭后。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":220,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":102,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o184","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-1096c71775017a1a0d00","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月，甲辰〖1〗，朐顗县获灵龟以献〖2〗，归之于相国府。庚戌〖3〗，以虎贲张修，昔于成都驰马至诸营，言钟会反逆，以至没身；赐修弟倚，爵关内侯。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p070b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-7f37a146755214a9b128","layer":"pei","quote":"晋武帝太始元年诏曰：‘故尚书王经，虽身陷法辟，然守志可嘉。门户堙没，意常愍之。其赐经孙郎中。","attribution":"《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":641,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-73667ee44886c1a2557e","start":62,"end":108,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-p070","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-7f37a146755214a9b128","layer":"pei","quote":"《汉晋春秋》曰：“经被收，辞母。母颜色不变，笑而应曰：‘人谁不死？往所以（不）止汝者，恐不得其所也。以此并命，何恨之有哉！’晋武帝太始元年诏曰：‘故尚书王经，虽身陷法辟，然守志可嘉。门户堙没，意常愍之。其赐经孙郎中。’”","attribution":"《汉晋春秋》；裴注载晋武帝诏","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":641,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-73667ee44886c1a2557e","start":0,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
